<h1>Bijan Robinson &amp; Jahmyr Gibbs: <em>The Combine Numbers Behind Their Standoff</em></h1>
<div class="meta-row">
<span>📖 8 min read</span>
<span>🏈 Football</span>
<span>💰 Contracts</span>
</div>
<p class="dek">Two of the NFL's best running backs held in at camp this summer, each waiting to see who would move first on a new contract. Robinson and Gibbs entered the league with almost opposite athletic profiles — here's how those 2023 combine numbers explain the very different backs they became.</p>
</div><div class="content">
<div class="toc">
